  "projectionPolicy": "Only task-query v2.3 waiting_input with attentionRequired=true, decisionKind=ocr-human-resolution and an opaque 64hex target token may open the dialog. New fields remain internal and are not serialized into frozen desktop semantic-state v1/v1.1.",
